 <div class="u_1669237233 dmRespRow" id="1669237233" data-page-element-type="section" data-page-element-id="1569827347"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1955459179"> <div class="u_1844016002 dmRespCol small-12 medium-12 large-12" id="1844016002"> <div class="u_1426211331 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1426211331" style="transition: none; text-align: left; display: block;"><p><span style="display: unset;"><span style="display: unset;">T&aacute;, mas como vai funcionar o programa, na pr&aacute;tica?</span> 
