 <div class="u_1332147165 dmRespRow" id="1332147165" data-page-element-type="section" data-page-element-id="1162074076"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1977323718"> <div class="u_1396599112 dmRespCol small-12 large-6 medium-6" id="1396599112"> <div class="u_1854915161 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1854915161" style="text-align: left; transition: none 0s ease 0s; display: block;"> <h2 class="m-size-26 size-32" style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><strong style="font-weight: bold; display: unset; color: rgb(194, 85, 25);" class="m-font-size-26 font-size-32">Partiu fazer a inscri&ccedil;&atilde;o?</strong><span class="m-font-size-26 font-size-32" style="font-weight: normal; display: unset; color: rgb(194, 85, 25);"> <span style="font-weight: normal; display: unset; color: rgb(194, 85, 25);" class="m-font-size-26 font-size-32">Chegou a hora de fazer parte deste movimento!</span></span></h2> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1243743735 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1243743735" style="text-align: left; transition: none; display: block;"><p class="m-size-19 size-24" style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><span class="m-font-size-19 font-size-24" style="color: var(--color_6); display: unset;">Para participar &eacute; simples,</span></p><p class="m-size-19 size-24" style="letter-spacing: -0.05em;"><strong class="m-font-size-19 font-size-24" style="display: unset; color: var(--color_6); font-weight: bold;">confira nosso passo a passo ➞</strong></p></div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1669668704 dmRespCol small-12 large-6 medium-6" id="1669668704"> <div class="u_1889079671 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1889079671" style="text-align: left; transition: none; display: block;"><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="color: var(--color_2); display: initial; font-weight: bold;">1.</strong><span style="display: initial; font-weight: normal;" single-space="true"> <span style="display: initial; font-weight: normal;"></span> 
</span><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold;">Leia o edital</strong><span style="display: initial;" single-space="true"> <span style="display: initial;"></span> 
</span><span style="display: initial; font-weight: normal;">para entender todos os detalhes do programa.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color_2);">2.</strong><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">Clique em qualquer um dos bot&otilde;es de &quot;inscreva-se&quot; do nosso site.&nbsp;</span> 
</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color_2);">3.</strong><span style="display: initial;" single-space="true"> <span style="display: initial;"></span> 
</span><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Fa&ccedil;a seu cadastro na plataforma do edital.</strong></p><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color_2);">4.</strong><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">Responda as perguntas da pr&eacute;-inscri&ccedil;&atilde;o e siga para o preenchimento da do formul&aacute;rio de documentos.</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color_2);">5.</strong><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">Para te ajudar nesta fase, em breve teremos uma biblioteca de tutoriais, com v&iacute;deos e exemplos.</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color_2);">6.</strong><span style="display: initial;"> <span style="display: initial;">Preencha o formul&aacute;rio com calma, conte com nosso time e tire todas as suas d&uacute;vidas.</span></span></p><p style="line-height: 1.6;"><strong style="display: initial; font-weight: bold; color: var(--color_2);">7.</strong> <span style="display: initial;">Aguarde pois, at&eacute; dia 29/01/2027, as organiza&ccedil;&otilde;es receber&atilde;o a resposta.<br/></span></p></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
